ate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/23/growing-share-of-americans-say-social-media-is-an-important-news-source-for-them/</guid></item><item><title>家庭生活中的女性、工作和护理</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/social-trends/2026/10/22/women-work-and-caregiving-through-the-arc-of-family-life/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/ST_26.10.22_AspenGender_featured@2x.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;在美国，性别、工作和照顾在家庭生活中常常交织在一起。大多数有 18 岁以下子女的父母都有工作。随着人口老龄化，越来越多的美国人正在照顾年老的父母。事实上，许多美国成年人夹在两种角色之间，既支持孩子又支持父母。什么时候 […]&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:12:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/social-trends/2026/10/22/women-work-and-caregiving-through-the-arc-of-family-life/</guid></item><item><title>在人工智能相关的职业中，男性的就业增长速度高于女性</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/22/men-are-experiencing-more-job-growth-than-women-in-ai-exposed-occupations/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/ST_26.10.22_AspenGender_featured@2x_c7d5fb.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;在最受人工智能影响的职业中，男性就业增长快于女性，这一差距主要是由没有学士学位的工人造成的。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:12:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/22/men-are-experiencing-more-job-growth-than-women-in-ai-exposed-occupations/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普第二任期内司法任命步伐放缓</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/21/pace-of-trumps-judicial-appointments-has-slowed-in-his-second-term/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/SR_26.10.21_judicial-appointments_crop.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;特朗普总统在本届任期内任命的联邦法官数量少于他第一届任期内的数量，而且他的步伐落后于最近几任总统。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:12:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/21/pace-of-trumps-judicial-appointments-has-slowed-in-his-second-term/</guid></item></channel></rss>